- BattleProjectilePool.h/.cpp (new, spec ranged-stack section 3.3, ADR-27):
  the SoA pooled store -- NOT entities, NOT actors; (index, generation)
  identity; Reserve-only allocation (Acquire fails closed into the Drops
  metric, RC9); LIFO free list; battle Reset preserves generations.
- BattleRanged.cpp: the task-0 stubs replaced with the T3.3-locked bodies:
  SelectVolleyShots (eligibility ladder: reload/ammo/rank/range -> LOS fire
  rule: arced frontage vs flat full lane, RC2/RC3 -> friendly rules A7: flat
  lane corridor + arced impact-zone tolerance -> solve + disperse + mutate
  views: the accounting IS the shot, RC5); EvaluateSkirmish (RC7 truth
  table: break trigger regardless of fire toggle, hysteresis resume).
  FVolleyShooterView gains RangeM (the fragment-stamped weapon range).
- MassBattleRangedTests.cpp: T3.3 family appended -- Pool (fails closed,
  never grows, stale generations, churn, reset), AmmoAccounting (shots ==
  decrements == ShotsFired sum; conservation; empty quivers never fire;
  fraction invariants), VolleySelection (rank limits, range window, the
  arced-over-hill vs flat-holds demonstrable pair, friendly holds both
  rules, reload staggering), SkirmishMath (the RC7 truth table).

MUST re-run on the UE machine: unit tier (the six Battle.Unit.Ranged.* tests
green; cvar-default dependence documented: VolleyRanks=2, ReloadInterval=3,
MinRangeM=8). Static patch: brace-balanced, include-complete; no engine
build was available at author time.
